    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/eb468c8c50a52de2d35bf99506da7de1.poster.avif?t=1755759654\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/eb468c8c50a52de2d35bf99506da7de1.webm?t=1755759654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/eb468c8c50a52de2d35bf99506da7de1.mp4?t=1755759654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3e\u00a0<strong>Embark on an adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ta-Miu is a narrative action-adventure set in ancient Egypt, filled with exploration, environmental puzzles, and platforming challenges. Play as the cat Ta-Miu, save the Pharaoh from the god Seth, and restore balance between the world of humans and the gods!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728\u00a0<strong>A magical world of the living and the dead</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross the boundary between the realm of mortals and the land of spirits. The eastern bank of the Nile is a bustling city of the living, while the western side belongs to the dead and supernatural forces.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc08\u00a0<strong>A heroine with claws</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse ruins and palaces as a nimble cat. Climb, balance, and solve environmental puzzles inspired by Egyptian mythology.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f\u00a0<strong>Mythology in practice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is inspired by a different deity and their powers. Meet Bastet, Thoth, Isis, Horus, Osiris, and more \u2013 earning their blessings to unlock unique abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd1d\u00a0<strong>Companions and bonds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend Sahi, a loyal mummy companion from the land of the dead, and visit the enigmatic merchant cat to play rounds of the ancient Egyptian game Senet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcdc\u00a0<strong>Style and authenticity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born from a passion for Egyptian mythology and culture, Ta-Miu was designed and created by an archaeologist-egyptologist. The game combines magic and reflection with authentic cultural inspirations \u2013 free of violence, but full of wonder and respect for the history and myths of ancient Egypt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/632544e948b87800400525e67cea4430.poster.avif?t=1755759654\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/632544e948b87800400525e67cea4430.webm?t=1755759654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/632544e948b87800400525e67cea4430.mp4?t=1755759654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/6988060ceefe0a3c10731d1e0c9c4014.poster.avif?t=1755759654\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/6988060ceefe0a3c10731d1e0c9c4014.webm?t=1755759654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/6988060ceefe0a3c10731d1e0c9c4014.mp4?t=1755759654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/eb468c8c50a52de2d35bf99506da7de1.poster.avif?t=1755759654\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/eb468c8c50a52de2d35bf99506da7de1.webm?t=1755759654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/eb468c8c50a52de2d35bf99506da7de1.mp4?t=1755759654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3e\u00a0<strong>Embark on an adventure!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ta-Miu is a narrative action-adventure set in ancient Egypt, filled with exploration, environmental puzzles, and platforming challenges. Play as the cat Ta-Miu, save the Pharaoh from the god Seth, and restore balance between the world of humans and the gods!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728\u00a0<strong>A magical world of the living and the dead</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross the boundary between the realm of mortals and the land of spirits. The eastern bank of the Nile is a bustling city of the living, while the western side belongs to the dead and supernatural forces.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc08\u00a0<strong>A heroine with claws</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse ruins and palaces as a nimble cat. Climb, balance, and solve environmental puzzles inspired by Egyptian mythology.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf1f\u00a0<strong>Mythology in practice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is inspired by a different deity and their powers. Meet Bastet, Thoth, Isis, Horus, Osiris, and more \u2013 earning their blessings to unlock unique abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd1d\u00a0<strong>Companions and bonds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend Sahi, a loyal mummy companion from the land of the dead, and visit the enigmatic merchant cat to play rounds of the ancient Egyptian game Senet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcdc\u00a0<strong>Style and authenticity</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born from a passion for Egyptian mythology and culture, Ta-Miu was designed and created by an archaeologist-egyptologist. The game combines magic and reflection with authentic cultural inspirations \u2013 free of violence, but full of wonder and respect for the history and myths of ancient Egypt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/632544e948b87800400525e67cea4430.poster.avif?t=1755759654\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/632544e948b87800400525e67cea4430.webm?t=1755759654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/632544e948b87800400525e67cea4430.mp4?t=1755759654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/6988060ceefe0a3c10731d1e0c9c4014.poster.avif?t=1755759654\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/6988060ceefe0a3c10731d1e0c9c4014.webm?t=1755759654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825470/extras/6988060ceefe0a3c10731d1e0c9c4014.mp4?t=1755759654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Play as a cat chosen by the goddess Bastet. Solve ancient puzzles, unlock magical powers, and uncover the secrets of Egypt filled with myths, temples, and tombs. Embark on a mystical adventure and stop an ancient evil!",
